    title: "What Is Jet Blast and How Does It Affect Building Design?" ,
    description: "Jet blast — high-velocity engine exhaust — imposes pressure, heat, and debris loads on buildings near runup, deicing, and cargo areas.",
    h1: "What Is Jet Blast and How Does It Affect Building Design?",
