        body: "Vertical conveyors and EDS machines need floor openings that are structural events — trimmed openings with the load path rerouted around them, designed before the slab is poured. Maintenance catwalks need their own support steel and egress; motor pull space needs headroom the MEP design must protect. Apex Grid details the openings, supports, and access zones in the construction documents with the BHS vendor's input locked — because the most expensive baggage-system change order is the one that cuts a designed slab."
